{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/8","id":4885097971,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVLzC488AAAABIyyt8w","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/8","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/8.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/8.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/8","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/8/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/8/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/8/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/statuses/da4107f8bf525b773c8b40899f443c292c3e6dbd","number":8,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"A04: Linux ELF workload baseline, pinned rootfs and guarded differential replay","user":{"login":"Franksudoman","id":273670192,"node_id":"U_kgDOEE_gMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273670192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman","html_url":"https://github.com/Franksudoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## A04 Linux userland compatibility baseline\n\nThis draft PR records reproducible original-Linux behavior, fixed rootfs/workload inputs, fixed-commit Hepta evidence, guarded QEMU replay, and the first real Asterinas guest capability probe. It does not claim full Debian13 ELF compatibility or authenticated Hepta W1 completion.\n\n### Current head and fixed inputs\n\n- Branch: agents/A04-linux-hepta-baseline\n- Current head: da4107f8bf525b773c8b40899f443c292c3e6dbd\n- Asterinas v0.19.0: c4b7ed575b7b32773475b194d2ad41fb8d9345\n- Hepta source: f8c9419df6ddeb36ff8b522a50219981fb8d9345\n- Rootfs manifest SHA-256: 55aa8369d4f912267139ef7626c752814d7dc833e49accc337529f2545fb94cb\n- USTAR SHA-256: df8df2e3cdcd308ef62a59268a4519e2923c9ff78145e46f26a4092725e80797\n- Catalog SHA-256: 64b268956848d4fd97c6ace51343d607f20495d7bd317491a5bf7ead5e672db0\n\n### Evidence\n\n- Host workload tests: 87 OK / 6 managed-host skips, also under python3 -O; catalog 31 pass + 1 Tokio not_run.\n- Original Linux chroot/staged C ELF: 28/28; five-round stress: 90/90; SQLite WAL source workaround passes.\n- QEMU 8.2.2 and accepted SeaBIOS were extracted under /tmp only; A01 kernel/initramfs booted under TCG and exited 33.\n- Guest capability probe: 13 cases, 11 pass. Pathname/abstract AF_UNIX and peer credentials pass in guest.\n- Real guest gaps: MSG_CMSG_CLOEXEC leaves FD_CLOEXEC clear; RLIMIT_NOFILE soft=32 still permits 256 opens without EMFILE. Evidence: tests/workloads/linux/baselines/guest-qemu-probe-20261017.json.\n- Exact Debian13 package/toolchain reconstruction was attempted without system installation; all four rebuilt ELF hashes differ from the manifest. Evidence: tests/workloads/linux/baselines/exact-rootfs-input-recheck-20261017.json. The original rootfs/ELF bytes are still required.\n\n### Hepta and remaining owners\n\n- Fixed Hepta e2e build exited 101 with zero Wiremock Responses requests and no terminal receipt; provider audit finds zero concrete invocation-provider implementations/attachments.\n- A05: fix MSG_CMSG_CLOEXEC and RLIMIT_NOFILE, then rerun focused probes.\n- A06: retain passing futex/thread/signal/robust-owner-death probes.\n- A07: supply authenticated provider composition and independent tool-effect receipt.\n- A00/A01: supply the exact rootfs tar and four manifest-pinned ELF files for full replay.\n\nAll changed files remain under compat/linux/**, support/rootfs/**, tests/workloads/linux/**; root README.md remains empty.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T07:38:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T00:36:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d9ac6790eb86e69b29cfb1afc3bcc4b238916d54","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:agents/A04-linux-hepta-baseline","ref":"agents/A04-linux-hepta-baseline","repo":{"id":1421656803,"node_id":"R_kgDOVLzC4w","name":"trillionnium-os-desktop","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6WizQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262513357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"